==Battleground==
*4 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
**6 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Similar to [[Woodlands Area 4]], but there are no [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] and [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] in this stage. Instead, the Heavenly Hippoes are 250% buffed. Use the same strategy as Woodlands Area 4. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] will also help a lot.

